48	\multicolumn{3}{l}{\textbf{Average (8-gen LOGO)}} & \textbf{0.694} & [.688, .700] & \textbf{0.762} \\
49	\multicolumn{3}{l}{\textbf{LOFO (family-level)}} & 0.686 & --- & --- \\
